# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Every variable here is OPTIONAL. With none set, the site runs in
# demo mode on a bundled dataset (no database) and is fully navigable.
# There are no user accounts — contributions are posted anonymously.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Database (optional) — set a PostgreSQL connection string to switch
# from the bundled demo dataset to a real database.
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://user:password@host:5432/postgres

# Public URLs — used for the sitemap and canonical / Open Graph metadata.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Daily price-snapshot cron (/api/cron/update-prices). Only needed in
# production with a database; set the same value in your host's env.
# CRON_SECRET=generate-a-long-random-string

# Affiliate / "Where to buy" links (all optional). Without them, the card
# pages still link out to each marketplace's search — just without earning a
# commission. Add your own ids to monetise.
#   CardNexus (multi-seller Riftbound aggregator). Affiliate deep-link prefix
#   from their partner program; links are wrapped as <prefix>?u=<destination>.
# CARDNEXUS_AFFILIATE_URL=
#   TCGplayer (Impact deep-link prefix, e.g. https://partner.tcgplayer.com/c/XXXX/YYYY/ZZZZ)
# TCGPLAYER_AFFILIATE_URL=
#   eBay Partner Network campaign id (10 digits)
# EBAY_CAMPID=
#   Cardmarket referral / utm_source tag
# CARDMARKET_AFFILIATE=
